\newlabel{lst:c25519-mac}{{4}{14}{The fused multiply--accumulate--carry core of the squaring kernel for a single limb. The register \texttt {TMP0} holds the low accumulator, \texttt {R8} the high accumulator, \texttt {TMP9} the running carry sum, and \texttt {TMP15} the transient \texttt {SETCC} carry. A multiplication, an accumulation, and a carry capture share one triad}{lstlisting.4}{}}
